# Wauvio voice profile. Every value is explicit; edit and load with load_profile().
voice akari
display Akari (灯)
language ja
notes Warm and luminous: a little brighter and more present than Yune with a stronger carrying formant, a livelier vibrato and clean, gently crisp consonants; glowing rather than icy.
natural_amount 0.32

# model
model_name Akari: warm, luminous Japanese female
range 54 89 42 96
vowel a 891 1498 3036 130 125 182 1 0.85 0
